  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic:**\n\n**2ⁿd number + (sum of all the numbers of 1st number) = 1st number**\n\n**2ⁿd number - (sum of the numbers of 3rd number) = 3rd number**\n\n**132,126,117**\n\n⇒ 126 + (1 + 3 + 2) = **132**\n\n⇒ 126 - (1 + 1 + 7) = **117**\n\n**1)** 122, 117, 19\n\n⇒ 117 + (1 + 2 + 2) =** 122**\n\n⇒ 117 - (1 + 9) = **107**\n\n**2) **118, 111, 102\n\n⇒ 111 + (1 + 1 + 8) =** 121**\n\n⇒ 111 - (1 + 0 + 2) = **108**\n\n**3) 124, 117, 108**\n\n**⇒ 117 + (1 + 2 + 4) = 124**\n\n**⇒ 117 - (1 + 0 + 8) = 108**\n\n**4)** 138, 132, 125\n\n⇒ 132 + (1 + 3 + 8) = **144**\n\n⇒ 132 - (1 + 2 + 5) =** 124**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"option(3)\".**",
